.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK WEBHOOK VIEW"
.SH NAME
hamstik webhook view \- View one webhook endpoint (the signing secret is never returned)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik webhook view [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
View one webhook endpoint (the signing secret is never returned)
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I WEBHOOK_ID
Webhook endpoint id
